      "orig": "Unatrac Holding Limited (UHL), owned by the Mansour family (which also owns Palm Hills Development, Metro Market and Chevrolet Agency in Egypt), is a leading Caterpillar dealer with exclusive rights in eleven countries across Africa, the Middle East, and Russia, and an export office in the UK. The Mansour Group began its Caterpillar dealership in Cairo over 40 years ago, expanding to Africa in 1997 and to Russia and Iraq in 2000. In 2011, the business was restructured under UHL and moved to Dubai. Unatrac, now the sole CAT dealer in eleven countries, recently added Ethiopia and Djibouti.",
      "text": "Unatrac Holding Limited (UHL), owned by the Mansour family (which also owns Palm Hills Development, Metro Market and Chevrolet Agency in Egypt), is a leading Caterpillar dealer with exclusive rights in eleven countries across Africa, the Middle East, and Russia, and an export office in the UK. The Mansour Group began its Caterpillar dealership in Cairo over 40 years ago, expanding to Africa in 1997 and to Russia and Iraq in 2000. In 2011, the business was restructured under UHL and moved to Dubai. Unatrac, now the sole CAT dealer in eleven countries, recently added Ethiopia and Djibouti."
